OL,3,GNEWSABBC hit comedy Two Doors Down
OL,4,Atakes to the stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter more than 40 years on our
OL,7,Fscreens, it's no surprise Elaine C
OL,8,FSmith is often recognised in the
OL,9,Fstreet.
OL,11,FThe twist is, these days it's not as
OL,12,Fherself but as Christine O'Neill, the
OL,13,Fcharacter she plays in the hit TV show
OL,14,FTwo Doors Down.
OL,16,FPeople just seem to know who Christine
OL,17,Fis.
OL,19,F"The amount of people that walk up to
OL,20,Fme and say 'do you know my granny? Do
OL,21,Fyou know my auntie?'", she jokes.
